邓云霄","text":"野老今朝兴动，山僧昨日书来。\n白云一片扶杖，明月千峰入杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其六 采药","author":"邓云霄","text":"数亩龙耕瑶草，几枝云护琪花。\n毛女洞前觅路，羽人门外停车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其七 采茶","author":"邓云霄","text":"童子才安铛臼，东风已展旗枪。\n幽径踏云自掇，品泉邀客同尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其八 泛舟","author":"邓云霄","text":"烟水惟便小艇，风波不到閒身。\n好对轻鸥野鹤，休论渔父秦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其九 栽花","author":"邓云霄","text":"换土栽培香国，围栏妆点花神。\n前世河阳仙吏，别号汉阴丈人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其十 种竹","author":"邓云霄","text":"君子珊珊苍玉，佳人楚楚绿衣。\n五月秋声先到，七贤酒兴同归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":25915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野兴十六首 其十一 采莲","author":"邓云霄","text":"流水周于舍下，轻舟自到门前。\n暑服新披白葛，吴歌去采红莲。","collection":"明"